{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-62476-r4524799","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Oatmeal Muffins","sourcePageId":62476,"sourceRevision":"4524799","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-07-18T00:58:49Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Oatmeal%20Muffins&oldid=4524799","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T13:09:32.266Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes for muffins","Category:Recipes using all-purpose flour","Category:Recipes using baking powder","Category:Recipes using baking soda","Category:Recipes using brown sugar","Category:Recipes using buttermilk","Category:Recipes using coconut","Category:Recipes using egg","Category:Recipes using margarine","Category:Recipes using oat","Category:Recipes with metric units","Category:Very Easy recipes"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"5837473cf4a2397d2e9a562ef963118b302979c3857cf5c1a0365273b090071a","sourceWikitext":"{{recipesummary|category=Breakfast recipes|servings=12|time=20–25 minutes|difficulty=1}}\n\n{{recipe}} | [[Cookbook:Bread|Bread]] |[[Cookbook:Breakfast|Breakfast]]\n\nA delicious muffin recipe that makes an excellent [[Cookbook:Breakfast|breakfast]].\n\n==Ingredients==\n\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] (240 [[Cookbook:Milliliter|ml]]) [[Cookbook:Oats|rolled oats]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] (240 ml) cultured [[Cookbook:Buttermilk|buttermilk]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Egg|egg]]\n* ¼ [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] (60 ml) [[Cookbook:Margarine|margarine]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] (240 ml) [[Cookbook:Flour|all-purpose flour]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|teaspoon]] [[Cookbook:Baking Powder|baking powder]]\n* ½ [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|teaspoon]] [[Cookbook:Baking Soda|baking soda]]\n* ¼ [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|teaspoon]] [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]]\n* ¾ [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] (180 ml) [[Cookbook:Brown Sugar|brown sugar]]\n* ¼ [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] (60 ml) [[Cookbook:Coconut|coconut]]\n\n== Procedure ==\n#Stir rolled oats and buttermilk together in a [[Cookbook:Mixing Bowl|mixing bowl]].\n#Combine flour, coconut, brown sugar, baking powder, baking soda, and salt in another [[Cookbook:Mixing Bowl|mixing bowl]]. Stir together to mix. Make a well in the center.\n#Add egg and margarine to oat mixture. Mix well.\n#Pour all at once into flour mixture. Stir just to moisten.\n#Fill muffin cups ¾ full.\n#[[Cookbook:Baking|Bake]] at [[Cookbook:Oven Temperatures|400°F]] (200°C) for 15–20 minutes.\n\n==Notes, tips, and variations==\n\n* '''Oatmeal raisin muffins:''' Add ½ cup (120 ml) [[Cookbook:Raisin|raisins]].\n* '''Blueberry oat muffins:''' Omit coconut and [[Cookbook:Folding|fold]] in 1 cup (240 ml) frozen [[Cookbook:Blueberry|blueberries]] before filling muffin cups.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using oat]]\n[[Category:Recipes for muffins]]\n[[Category:Recipes using coconut]]\n[[Category:Recipes_with_metric_units]]\n[[Category:Recipes using baking powder]]\n[[Category:Recipes using baking soda]]\n[[Category:Recipes using brown sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using buttermilk]]\n[[Category:Recipes using egg]]\n[[Category:Recipes using all-purpose flour]]\n[[Category:Recipes using margarine]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Oatmeal Muffins","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"1 cup (240 ml) rolled oats","sourceText":"1 cup (240 ml) rolled oats","amountText":"1 cup (240 ml) rolled oats","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"1 cup (240 ml) cultured buttermilk","sourceText":"1 cup (240 ml) cultured buttermilk","amountText":"1 cup (240 ml) cultured buttermilk","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"1 egg","sourceText":"1 egg","amountText":"1 egg","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"¼ cup (60 ml) margarine","sourceText":"¼ cup (60 ml) margarine","amountText":"¼ cup (60 ml) margarine","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"1 cup (240 ml) all-purpose flour","sourceText":"1 cup (240 ml) all-purpose flour","amountText":"1 cup (240 ml) all-purpose flour","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"1 teaspoon baking powder","sourceText":"1 teaspoon baking powder","amountText":"1 teaspoon baking powder","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-7","name":"½ teaspoon baking soda","sourceText":"½ teaspoon baking soda","amountText":"½ teaspoon baking soda","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-8","name":"¼ teaspoon salt","sourceText":"¼ teaspoon salt","amountText":"¼ teaspoon salt","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-9","name":"¾ cup (180 ml) brown sugar","sourceText":"¾ cup (180 ml) brown sugar","amountText":"¾ cup (180 ml) brown sugar","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-10","name":"¼ cup (60 ml) coconut","sourceText":"¼ cup (60 ml) coconut","amountText":"¼ cup (60 ml) coconut","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null}],"steps":[{"n":1,"text":"Stir rolled oats and buttermilk together in a mixing bowl.","sourceText":"Stir rolled oats and buttermilk together in a mixing bowl.","durationMinutes":null},{"n":2,"text":"Combine flour, coconut, brown sugar, baking powd